(* README *)

1 - Summary
    -------

    L002 separates two positions that behave differently after specialization
    to M001. A full L001 negation fixed point `chi <-> not chi` collapses the
    checked theory unconditionally. The consistent premise for Mirror
    Unrefutability is instead the one-way `ExternalMirrorPosition`
    `not chi -> chi`; consistency then makes `chi` internally irrefutable.

    The package separates this irrefutability from recognition of its source.
    An adequate internal recognition certificate would reconstruct the
    counter-position, re-enter the mirror relation, and derive `Bot`.
    Consistency therefore entails both continuation under the mirrored
    assumption and opacity of its mirror-position status.

    The seed-based Recursive Mirror Lemma extends the result from one external
    mirror position to every finite iterate of a supplied mirror operation whose
    position preservation is proved. Attribution and observable
    externalization are obtained through explicit response laws for a concrete
    regulator.

    A finite operational layer leaves the formula language unrestricted. Its
    logical refinement adds a deterministic transition, a formula observation
    for every state, and proofs that each observed formula is `AsIF` and
    recognition-opaque. Continued operation constructively yields a repeated
    state and repeated logical observation within the first `N + 1` samples.
    A provenance operational layer assigns an explicit internal/external tag to
    every state, producing first-class attribution observations. An externally
    tagged observation with matching logical content satisfies L002's concrete
    operational externalization relation.


